a-da-silva.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva</span><span class="tp">b. 1945</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 27 October <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/aethelstan"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/aethelstan.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Æthelstan</span><span class="tp">c. 894–939</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/hugh-iv-duke-of-burgundy"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/hugh-iv-duke-of-burgundy.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Hugh IV, Duke of Burgundy</span><span class="tp">1213–1272</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/mahaut-countess-of-artois"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/mahaut-countess-of-artois.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Mahaut, Countess of Artois</span><span class="tp">c. 1268–1329</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/abu-al-fida"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Abu al-Fida</span><span class="tp">1273–1331</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/vytautas-the-great"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/vytautas-the-great.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Vytautas the Great</span><span class="tp">c. 1350–1430</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/albert-ii-of-germany"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/albert-ii-of-germany.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Albert II of Germany</span><span class="tp">1397–1439</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ulugh-beg"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ulugh-beg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ulugh Beg</span><span class="tp">d. 1449</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/nestor-kirchner"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/nestor-kirchner.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Néstor Kirchner</span><span class="tp">1950–2010</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
